# File Conventions

## TypeScript / TSX

- Use explicit types for component props and data transforms.
- Avoid duplicating menu/route construction logic.
- Keep navigation behavior centralized.

## Styles

- Prefer local module styles (`*.module.less`) for feature UI.
- Avoid broad global selectors unless required by antd override scenarios.

## Documentation

- If architecture, behavior, or conventions change, update `docs/` in the same task.

